#: ../../../release_details/9.7/pythonic-array-selection.md:1
msgid "Dictionary interface for vtkDataArraySelection"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/pythonic-array-selection.md:3
msgid ""
"`vtkDataArraySelection` now supports a Python dictionary interface. You can "
"get, set, and delete array enable/disable states using standard dictionary "
"syntax:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/pythonic-array-selection.md:7
msgid ""
"sel = reader.GetPointDataArraySelection()\n"
"sel[\"Pressure\"] = True\n"
"if \"Velocity\" in sel:\n"
"    enabled = sel[\"Velocity\"]\n"
"for name, state in sel.items():\n"
"    print(name, state)\n"
msgstr ""
